359	// to message in trailer-block-aware format. If the message's final paragraph is a
360	// trailer block by the same grammar finalTrailerBlock reads with, the line is
361	// joined directly to it; otherwise a blank line is inserted first to start a new
362	// trailer block. Sharing the grammar is the contract: a paragraph the writer joins
